---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";

interface Props { lang: "fr" | "en" }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
---
{lang === "fr" ? (
<Base title="À propos">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>À propos</h1>
    <p>Votovision est un projet personnel et indépendant, sans affiliation partisane, sans commanditaire et sans
    publicité. Les mêmes traitements s'appliquent à tous les partis ; les résultats sont présentés en
    probabilités et en intervalles.</p>
    <p>Votovision est conçu et maintenu par Essi Parent
    (<a href="https://github.com/essicolo">github.com/essicolo</a>).</p>
    <img class="portrait" src="/essi.jpg" width="800" height="533" alt="Essi Parent devant un graphique projeté, en train de l'expliquer" loading="lazy" />

    <h2>Code et données ouverts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Modèles : <a href="https://github.com/votovision/quebec">votovision/quebec</a>, <a href="https://github.com/votovision/bc">votovision/bc</a> et <a href="https://github.com/votovision/canada">votovision/canada</a>, licence GNU GPL v3.</li>
      <li>Données : <a href="https://github.com/votovision/data">votovision/data</a>, licence CC BY-SA 4.0, avec
      les attributions requises par chaque source.</li>
      <li>Site : <a href="https://github.com/votovision/votovision.github.io">votovision/votovision.github.io</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Les calculs (transformations compositionnelles, processus gaussiens, simulation) sont effectués avec
    la suite <a href="https://suite.tangent.to">tangent/suite</a>.</p>

    <h2>Signaler une erreur</h2>
    <p>Les erreurs, dans les données comme dans le code, se signalent par une demande (« issue ») sur le dépôt
    concerné.</p>

    <h2>Citer</h2>
    <p>Votovision, prévisions électorales, https://votovision.github.io, avec la date de consultation.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
) : (
<Base title="About">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Votovision is a personal and independent project, with no partisan affiliation, no sponsor and no
    advertising. Every party is processed the same way; results are reported as probabilities and
    intervals.</p>
    <p>Votovision is designed and maintained by Essi Parent
    (<a href="https://github.com/essicolo">github.com/essicolo</a>).</p>
    <img class="portrait" src="/essi.jpg" width="800" height="533" alt="Essi Parent in front of a projected chart, explaining it" loading="lazy" />

    <h2>Open code and data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Models: <a href="https://github.com/votovision/quebec">votovision/quebec</a>, <a href="https://github.com/votovision/bc">votovision/bc</a> and <a href="https://github.com/votovision/canada">votovision/canada</a>, GNU GPL v3 licence.</li>
      <li>Data: <a href="https://github.com/votovision/data">votovision/data</a>, CC BY-SA 4.0 licence, with the
      attributions each source requires.</li>
      <li>Site: <a href="https://github.com/votovision/votovision.github.io">votovision/votovision.github.io</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Computations (compositional transformations, Gaussian processes, simulation) are carried out with
    the <a href="https://suite.tangent.to">tangent/suite</a>.</p>

    <h2>Reporting an error</h2>
    <p>Errors in the data or the code can be reported by opening an issue on the relevant repository.</p>

    <h2>Citation</h2>
    <p>Votovision, election forecasts, https://votovision.github.io, with the date of access.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
)}
